# civil-holidays v1
# jurisdiction: CA
# source: https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/H-5/page-1.html
#   (Holidays Act, R.S.C. 1985 c. H-5: New Year's, Canada Day with its Sunday
#   shift, Remembrance Day, Christmas; local copy
#   papers/holidays/ca_holidays_act_justice.html). Provincial statutory holidays
#   were cross-checked against vacanza/holidays 0.101 (MIT) and the provincial
#   employment-standards listings it cites.
#
#   SCOPE DECISION (documented): federal set (subdiv None) plus a COMPACT
#   provincial sample — CA-ON, CA-QC, CA-BC, CA-AB, CA-MB, CA-NS — chosen to
#   exercise every provincial rule shape (Victoria Day / National Patriots' Day
#   via the Monday-preceding-25-May rule; the four "third Monday of February"
#   variants Family Day / Louis Riel Day / Heritage Day; nth-weekday Thanksgiving
#   and BC Day; Saint-Jean-Baptiste; Remembrance Day; Boxing Day). The remaining
#   provinces/territories are future data. Canada Day carries the federal Holidays
#   Act Sunday->Monday shift (sun_mon).
# retrieved: 2026-07-21
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school (+ vacanza-parity labels, see below)
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed
#
# Canada is officially bilingual federally, so the federal holidays carry both
# the English (en) and French (fr) official names. The primary name stays the
# English one (the join key used by the golds); French is added in `names`.
# --- federal (Holidays Act) ---
fixed       | en:New Year's Day ;; fr:Jour de l'An | 1 1   | public          |  |
easter      | en:Good Friday ;; fr:Vendredi saint  | -2    | public religious |  |
fixed       | en:Canada Day ;; fr:Fête du Canada   | 7 1   | public          |  | sun_mon
nth_weekday | en:Labour Day ;; fr:Fête du travail  | 9 1 0 | public          |  |
fixed       | en:Christmas Day ;; fr:Noël          | 12 25 | public religious |  |
#
# --- Ontario (CA-ON) ---
nth_weekday      | Family Day      | 2 3 0   | public | CA-ON |
weekday_onbefore | Victoria Day    | 5 24 0  | public | CA-ON |
nth_weekday      | Thanksgiving Day| 10 2 0  | public | CA-ON |
fixed            | Boxing Day      | 12 26   | public | CA-ON |
#
# --- Quebec (CA-QC): French is the official language of the province ---
weekday_onbefore | en:National Patriots' Day ;; fr:Journée nationale des patriotes | 5 24 0 | public | CA-QC |
fixed            | fr:Saint-Jean-Baptiste ;; en:Saint-Jean-Baptiste Day           | 6 24   | public religious | CA-QC |
nth_weekday      | en:Thanksgiving Day ;; fr:Action de grâce                       | 10 2 0 | public | CA-QC |
#
# --- British Columbia (CA-BC) ---
nth_weekday      | Family Day                            | 2 3 0  | public | CA-BC |
weekday_onbefore | Victoria Day                          | 5 24 0 | public | CA-BC |
nth_weekday      | British Columbia Day                  | 8 1 0  | public | CA-BC |
fixed            | National Day for Truth and Reconciliation | 9 30 | public | CA-BC |
nth_weekday      | Thanksgiving Day                      | 10 2 0 | public | CA-BC |
fixed            | Remembrance Day                       | 11 11  | public | CA-BC |
#
# --- Alberta (CA-AB) ---
nth_weekday      | Family Day       | 2 3 0  | public | CA-AB |
weekday_onbefore | Victoria Day     | 5 24 0 | public | CA-AB |
nth_weekday      | Thanksgiving Day | 10 2 0 | public | CA-AB |
fixed            | Remembrance Day  | 11 11  | public | CA-AB |
#
# --- Manitoba (CA-MB) ---
nth_weekday      | Louis Riel Day   | 2 3 0  | public | CA-MB |
weekday_onbefore | Victoria Day     | 5 24 0 | public | CA-MB |
fixed            | National Day for Truth and Reconciliation | 9 30 | public | CA-MB |
nth_weekday      | Thanksgiving Day | 10 2 0 | public | CA-MB |
#
# --- Nova Scotia (CA-NS) ---
nth_weekday      | Heritage Day    | 2 3 0 | public | CA-NS |
fixed            | Remembrance Day | 11 11 | public | CA-NS |

# --- vacanza/holidays 0.101 category parity (retrieved 2026-07-22) ---
# Extra non-default-category rows cross-checked against vacanza/holidays
# 0.101 (MIT) `country_holidays(cc, categories=(...))` output for 2024 and
# 2025 (both years agree; dates are stable Gregorian fixed days per vacanza's
# own country module). Names are vacanza's own (already-localized) labels.
fixed | Boxing Day | 12 26 | optional |  |

# --- vacanza/holidays 0.101 category parity, decree-tabulated
# (year-varying government-category subset; retrieved 2026-07-22) ---
decree | National Day for Truth and Reconciliation | 2024-9-30 2025-9-30 | government |  |
decree | Thanksgiving Day | 2024-10-14 2025-10-13 | government |  |
decree | Remembrance Day | 2024-11-11 2025-11-11 | government |  |
decree | Boxing Day | 2024-12-26 2025-12-26 | government |  |
